PUMP FIGHTERS
A fan-made, non-commercial mod of Street Fighter III: 3rd Strike.

Not affiliated with, endorsed by or sponsored by Capcom Co., Ltd.
Street Fighter and Street Fighter III: 3rd Strike are trademarks of Capcom Co., Ltd.
No Capcom game data is included in this repository or its releases. Players must supply SF33RD.AFS
from their own copy of the game.

Third-party characters
----------------------
The fighters are fan-art versions of characters, mascots and memes from the pump.fun and wider crypto
community (SWORDCAT, INU, JEAN PHIL, ELON, PEPE, CLAUDIA, WIF, POPCAT, PNUT, MOO DENG, GIGA, GOAT,
CHILL GUY, PONKE, MEW, PIPPIN, SLERF, BONK, FWOG, PILL). Those characters, names and likenesses belong to
their respective creators, owners and communities. They are used here as fan art and parody, with no claim
of ownership and no endorsement implied. ELON is a parody of a public figure and is not endorsed by him.
If you hold rights in one of these characters and want it changed or removed, open an issue.

Third-party software
--------------------
- 3SX (https://github.com/crowded-street/3sx), AGPL-3.0. web/3sx-web.patch is a patch to 3SX and is
  distributed under the same license.
- 3s-psp (https://github.com/demmis98/3s-psp). Not included; linked only.
- PPSSPP (https://www.ppsspp.org/). Not included; linked only.
- @ably/vcdiff-decoder (Apache-2.0), an optional dev dependency of patcher/ used as a second decoder in
  tests. Not included; installed by npm.
- RTMPose / rtmlib (Apache-2.0), used by tools/sf3mod/pose.py and mesh.py for pose reading. Not included;
  installed by pip.
